The release archive bundles binaries built from kimodo.cpp
(https://github.com/localai-org/kimodo.cpp), Copyright the kimodo.cpp authors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Those binaries are built from a modified copy of kimodo.cpp. The modifications
are the patches under patches/ in this repository, which make the pinned
revision compile with MSVC: one adds a missing <stdexcept> include, and the
other converts a std::filesystem::path to a narrow string before handing it to
a C API that takes one. Neither changes behaviour.

kimodo.cpp carries the following notice:

    kimodo.cpp

    This project uses ggml, Copyright the ggml authors:
    https://github.com/ggml-org/ggml

    The demo displays the LocalAI logo from the LocalAI project:
    https://github.com/mudler/LocalAI

